``` KV-05 | Slow KV Store Operations and Lock Contention
    Interpretation and RCA: Splunk Administrator Field Manual (Gaurav Malik),
    entry KV-05. https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HRXCT384

    Run on: SH.
    Query: Lock queue depth (SH)
    If this returns nothing, run probes/KV-05-probe.spl to confirm the data it
    reads exists here.
```
index=_introspection sourcetype=kvstore component=KVStoreServerStats
    earliest=-4h
| eval readers='data.globalLock.currentQueue.readers',
       writers='data.globalLock.currentQueue.writers',
       conns='data.connections.current'
| timechart span=5m max(readers) as read_queue max(writers) as write_queue
        max(conns) as connections by host
